BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weekend-at-burney-runwalkcrawl-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART:20261022T180000Z
DTEND:20261022T220000Z
SUMMARY:Weekend at Burney Run/Walk/Crawl
DESCRIPTION:A laid-back\, high-fun trail adventure featuring a 4.8-mile looped course with 370 ft elevation gain per loop. Offers multiple timed event options (48-Hour\, 24-Hour\, 12-Hour challenges) with a 50/50 mix of single-track and dirt service road terrain. Includes burro racing option. Features aid station with snacks\, hot food\, and broth bar. Cash prizes awarded for most miles run\, with belt buckles for 100+ mile finishers.
LOCATION:22800 Guest Ranch Rd\, Cassel\, CA 96016
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
