DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T080000Z
DTEND:20261205T120000Z
SUMMARY:COLDERBoulder
DESCRIPTION:COLDERBoulder 5K winter race featuring 13 invitational races organized by pace (for previous BOLDERBoulder/COLDERBoulder participants)\, 1 open race\, and 1 walking wave. All participants receive medals. Top 3 finishers in each invitational race earn special Cold Medals. Includes Holiday Finish Fest with burritos\, doughnuts\, coffee\, and hot cocoa. Virtual race option available. Registration opens October 1st and sells out annually.
LOCATION:CU Campus\, Boulder\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
